      "value": "@{59b80cbbd1662e660835c7c5|full_name}: Sorry! I totally forgot to include this crucial part!\nI'm using a Vive with the Vive Wireless. I believe the game freezes as the headset goes into standby. Possibly Wireless power saving of some kind...?\nIt'll show the headset as gray in SteamVR until the HMD is moved again and becomes active, but during this time VRChat freezes and times out of the instance.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
