      "value": "@{59b80cbbd1662e660835c7c5|full_name}: This has happened to me with the basic wired HTC Vive headset as well. I put the thing down to go use the restroom and stuff and when I came back this exact same behavior happened to me. Latest version VRChat. It probably doesn't happen to me nearly as often as it does to Curtis so I didn't look at the SteamVR status, but I would expect it was marked inactive.\n\nIf you don't have a Vive Wireless you might be able to reproduce by simply unplugging the power to the 3-in-1 box and waiting a bit, then plugging it back in.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
