      "value": "@{59b80cbbd1662e660835c7c5|full_name}: After further testing, it's from tracking loss with the Vive. Not sure the same issue happens with the Rift.\nWhen tracking is lost, after a few seconds the game will freeze. This freeze causes you to be timed out. When you return, the headset regains tracking and the game unfreezes, then returns you to your home world due to the timeout.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
