  "details": "When removing your headset for too long (Possibly when the device is no longer tracking?) VRChat freezes, when you return and put the headset back on and the game unfreezes, you are kicked to your home world due to timing out from the instance.\n\nVersion: VRChat 2019.2.1p5\n(Previous versions also had the same issue for months)\nHeadset: Vive + Vive Wireless",
